# Going back to before one of the user's prompts: the prompt's own action, and
# the bar over the composer while the edit waits to be sent.

chat-rewind-edit = Edit from here
chat-rewind-unavailable = Edit from here isn't available with this agent
chat-rewind-busy = Wait for the edit being sent to finish
chat-rewind-title = Editing an earlier prompt. Sending drops it and everything after it.
chat-rewind-cancel = Cancel
chat-rewind-keep = Keep files
chat-rewind-restore = Restore files
chat-rewind-keep-note = Only the conversation goes back. Files stay as they are now.
chat-rewind-restore-note = Files go back to how they were when this prompt's turn started. The current state is saved as a checkpoint first, so this can be undone.
chat-rewind-checkpoint-looking = Looking for this prompt's checkpoint...
chat-rewind-checkpoint-missing = This prompt has no checkpoint, so its files can't be restored.
chat-rewind-checkpoint-unreachable = Checkpoints can't be reached for this chat, so its files can't be restored.
chat-rewind-files-lost = This prompt's attached files aren't known any more. Attach them again if they're still needed.
chat-rewind-restore-busy = Another chat is restoring this checkout's files. Send this edit once it finishes.
chat-rewind-restoring = Restoring files...
chat-rewind-sending = Going back...
